{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9e8e1274-3105-8be9-80e1-71676c1ba3be",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T10:27:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Kevin. Is it all right if I ask about a road problem? My name is Declan Sullivan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead, Mr. Sullivan. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a dip in the street in front of my house. Is it all right if I explain how it got there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, go for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A utility crew dug a trench across the road a while back and patched it. Since then the patch has settled and left a low spot. After last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, it looks a little worse to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a utility trench that settled. Got it. How big a dip are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across, I'd say. Is it all right if I say it's not deep, but a car drops into it with a thump?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's helpful. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:26:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "313 Dixon Street, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three-thirteen Dixon. Writing that down. Trench settlement, two feet across, in the travel lane in front of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:26:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right in front, toward the middle of the street. Could I ask you to add the street to the repair list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:26:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll put Dixon Street on the list for the crews to look at. Patches like that usually get checked in the order they come in, and they're busy after a storm, so give it a few weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:26:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is it all right if I mention my nephew works in the same building as you? He's here at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh yeah? Well, tell him I said hello. Do you want me to take a callback number, just so the crew can reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:27:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's 401-555-0179."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-nine. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:27:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you, Kevin. I appreciate your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Sullivan. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
